{"ticker":"KR","updated":"2026-10-23T23:12:56Z","profile":{"longName":"The Kroger Co.","shortName":"Kroger Company (The)","sector":"Consumer Defensive","industry":"Grocery Stores","country":"United States","website":"https://www.thekrogerco.com","fullTimeEmployees":400000,"marketCap":39433605120,"trailingPE":37.094444,"forwardPE":12.189289,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":0.26407728,"pegRatio":0.66,"targetMeanPrice":69.0,"targetHighPrice":85.0,"targetLowPrice":57.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":22,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.02,"earningsGrowth":0.153,"grossMargins":0.23900999,"operatingMargins":0.029779999,"profitMargins":0.0072600003,"totalRevenue":149326004224,"beta":0.353,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":76.58,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":54.15,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":2.3},"summary":"The Kroger Co. operates as a food and drug retailer in the United States. The company operates combination food and drug stores, multi-department stores, marketplace stores, and price impact warehouses. Its combination food and drug stores offer natural food and organic sections, pharmacies, general merchandise, pet centers, fresh seafood, and organic produce; and its multi-department stores provide apparel, home fashion and furnishings, outdoor living, electronics, automotive products, and toys. The company's marketplace stores offer full-service grocery, pharmacy, health and beauty care, and perishable goods, as well as general merchandise, including apparel, home goods, and toys; and its price impact warehouse stores provide grocery, and health and beauty care items, as well as meat, dairy, baked goods, and fresh produce items. It also manufactures and processes food products for sale in its supermarkets and online; and sells fuel through its fuel centers. The company sells its products through its stores, fuel centers, and online platforms. The Kroger Co. was founded in 1883 and is based in Cincinnati, Ohio.","summary_zh":"克羅格公司在美國經營食品和藥品零售商。該公司經營食品和藥局、綜合百貨商店、市場商店和價格影響倉庫。其食品和藥品綜合店提供天然食品和有機食品、藥房、日用品、寵物中心、新鮮海鮮和有機農產品；其多百貨商店提供服裝、家居時尚和家具、戶外生活、電子產品、汽車產品和玩具。該公司的市場商店提供全方位服務的雜貨、藥房、健康和美容護理、易腐爛商品以及一般商品，包括服裝、家居用品和玩具；其價格影響倉庫店提供雜貨、健康和美容護理用品，以及肉類、乳製品、烘焙食品和新鮮農產品。它還生產和加工食品，並在其超市和網上銷售；並透過其燃料中心銷售燃料。該公司透過其商店、加油中心和線上平台銷售其產品。克羅格公司成立於 1883 年，總部位於俄亥俄州辛辛那提。","sector_zh":"消費者防禦","industry_zh":"雜貨店","candles":[{"t":"2025-08-25","o":69.66,"h":70.47,"l":69.63,"c":70.14,"v":4419000},{"t":"2025-08-26","o":70.16,"h":70.41,"l":68.87,"c":68.99,"v":7751100},{"t":"2025-08-27","o":68.99,"h":69.34,"l":67.31,"c":67.98,"v":7987100},{"t":"2025-08-28","o":67.82,"h":67.98,"l":66.76,"c":67.46,"v":6584900},{"t":"2025-08-29","o":67.69,"h":67.89,"l":67.1,"c":67.84,"v":5422600},{"t":"2025-09-02","o":68.14,"h":68.98,"l":68.03,"c":68.64,"v":6333700},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":68.35,"h":68.58,"l":67.17,"c":68.2,"v":7197300},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":68.46,"h":68.72,"l":67.73,"c":67.84,"v":6231000},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":67.92,"h":68.2,"l":67.31,"c":67.75,"v":5575700},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":67.74,"h":68.18,"l":67.29,"c":68.0,"v":10184300},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":67.86,"h":67.9,"l":66.72,"c":67.63,"v":7418100},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":67.38,"h":67.7,"l":66.34,"c":67.03,"v":9319800},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":69.0,"h":69.89,"l":66.15,"c":67.23,"v":14059700},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":67.38,"h":68.98,"l":67.15,"c":68.29,"v":8312400},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":68.29,"h":69.09,"l":67.14,"c":67.41,"v":7557200},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":67.5,"h":68.05,"l":66.58,"c":66.75,"v":10520700},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":67.81,"h":68.02,"l":66.61,"c":66.96,"v":9126300},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":66.61,"h":66.76,"l":65.77,"c":65.99,"v":10664200},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":65.76,"h":65.98,"l":64.89,"c":65.58,"v":16411000},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":65.58,"h":65.6,"l":64.51,"c":64.52,"v":8939500},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":64.46,"h":65.47,"l":64.37,"c":65.35,"v":11228300},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":65.23,"h":65.88,"l":65.03,"c":65.55,"v":5260400},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":66.01,"h":66.5,"l":65.44,"c":65.49,"v":6037500},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":65.41,